# WMT Client - Root .htaccess
#
# This file is intentionally minimal. IONOS shared hosting restricts
# AllowOverride such that `Header` and `Options` directives in per-directory
# .htaccess are NOT honored — verified empirically 2026-04-11 by setting
# `Header set X-Test-Marker "active"` and observing it never landed on
# response headers.
#
# Consequence:
#   - Security response headers (HSTS, X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options,
#     Referrer-Policy) are emitted from PHP via emitSecurityHeaders() in
#     includes/security.php instead of via this .htaccess.
#   - F11 (Apache mod_negotiation MultiViews leaking file enumeration via
#     `300 Multiple Choices`) cannot be fixed at the application layer on
#     this host. The `Options -MultiViews` directive is silently ignored.
#     If migrated off IONOS shared hosting, add `Options -MultiViews` here.
#
# Per-directory deny rules (data/, config/, includes/, tools/) DO work in
# .htaccess on this host because they use `Require all denied`, which is
# permitted under the AuthConfig override class.
